# Summarizer API (src/) — variable names only, never commit real values.
# The CrewAI agent reads the OpenAI key from the environment.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# n8n side: these are created as Credentials in the n8n UI after import, not env vars.
#   - Gmail OAuth2 credential, one per inbox you want to read
#   - Notion API credential with access to your newsletter database
# Then replace in the workflow:
#   inbox-a@example.com / inbox-b@example.com   -> your inbox labels
#   the Gmail search query "from:(...) newer_than:5d" -> your own sender allowlist
#   <NOTION_DATA_SOURCE_ID>                     -> your Notion database / data source
#   <SUMMARIZER_HOST>                           -> where the FastAPI service listens
